name: Hideout Furniture — Runtime Editor and Workbench
author: Hardcoon
version: 0.5.22
description: Shared IX-Ray editor, Hideout Furniture 2.3.2, Expansion 1.0.2, Even More Hideout Furniture Update 2, native QA doors and portable repair, upgrade and crafting workbench. 160 furniture items, paired door placement actions, modes 1/2, translucent previews, unlimited lights, NPC doors and 1.4-second Use pickup.
